    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1783">

                <pb facs="1451" n="1335" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1335"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.1611/26.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of Salvador to
                        the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of Salvador</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-04-25">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 25, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to inform your
                    excellency that, under a resolution of my Government dated March 18 last, I have
                        <pb facs="1452" n="1336" xml:id="pg1336"/> been appointed Envoy
                    Extraordinary on Special Mission with the duty of offering to your Government
                    its feeling of profound gratitude for the cordial visit with which your
                    excellency honored us.</p>
                <p>In so informing your excellency, I beg you to learn from the President the day
                    and hour when he will be pleased to receive me; at the same time I beg leave to
                    enclose a copy of the remarks I shall have the honor to deliver on that
                    occasion.</p>
                <p>With assurances [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">F. Mejía.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
